ace_barcode_value, regex_replace, add_timestamp, format_date and the geometric set, which is the layer that makes a PDF from an accounting system acceptable to a Zebra printer and the layer that injects GS1-128 compliance into a barcode an ERP produced without it. The limits are the story the way the write envelope was for Sellfy: conversions travel through the asynchronous engine even though the vendor ships a sub-200ms synchronous REST route because that route is marked not exposed as a public MCP tool, listPipelines and getPipeline are the only pipeline tools so an agent can read the label recipes and cannot rewrite them, upload URLs expire in 15 minutes and results in 1 hour, and dynamic over-budget scaling keeps the line printing while billing overage per 1,000 tokens instead of halting. Four arrivals held with their class named: PatentRef, io.github.patentref/patentref-mcp 0.4.0 over a PatentsView-compatible API for US grants from 1976, held on the patent and IP research class carried by Patsnap and LegalCode with claim trees named in the tagline and absent from the tool list; Sanctionlistcheck.com, com.sanctionlistcheck/sanctionlistcheck 1.0.0 with screen_names over ten official lists at 1 credit per name and 100 free credits, held on the sanctions-screening class owned by ScreenVerity, QoreNext Trade Screening and Atlas Verified where a wider list set is a capability improvement and not a new class; ndekoui keyless with 7 tools over a React component catalogue as developer tooling; and ROVE Snow Forecast, com.rove-ski/snow-forecast 1.0.1 with 9 read-only tools over 667 resorts, a consumer vertical. The 28-slug cohort was dispositioned as one list because the flat sitemap proved none of them was an arrival: backlnk on the technical SEO and GEO class, loadoptimizer and fixragent already catalogued, motionreel revline spritulus viralance and flavo on media generation, merit-legal and ava-fund as prior holds, seller-labs-amazon on the Amazon seller class, change